      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, right margin",
          "value": "<p>The man who did business with me concerning the house of the sheikh Abu\u0304 \u2019l-\u2018Ala\u0304 died. These affairs happened with him, and he suffered for his action. Woe to us, how we have neglected our souls. May God inscribe you, my master, for a long life.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
