      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Arabic address",
          "value": "<p>To my master, the sheikh, Abu\u0304 Yah\u0323ya Nahray ibn Nissim.</p>\n<p>May God lengthen his remaining [days] and make permanent his peace and happiness.</p>\n<p>From Abu\u0304n ibn Tsedakah al-Maghribi\u0304, with his thanks.</p>\n<p>[Send to] Fust\u0101t, God Almighty willing.</p>\n<p>\u2018Amir ibn al-H\u0323usayn and his son; Ibra\u0304hi\u0304m ibn Naja.</p>\n<p>\u2018Umar ibn Yu\u0304suf and his son.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
